User mulling whether to wear dragon armor with a monk or not ...

... I ascended a monk not so long ago wearing dragon armor. I never
missed a to-hit on the ascension run.

There is, as mentioned, something on the order of a -20 to-hit for a
monk wearing body armor.  However, if I am level 20, the -20 to hit
exactly cancels out. If you then factor in my +13 luck (you HAVE maxed
your luck, right)? plus all the other bonuses, I believe you'll find
that you haven't lost much in the way of hitting ability but have
gained 9 or so points of AC. 

